{"formal_ids": ["GS-564"], "labels": ["中值定理", "凹凸性与拐点", "导数单调性", "广义积分", "拉格朗日中值定理", "数项级数敛散性判别", "无穷级数", "正项级数敛散性判别", "正项级数比较判别法", "积分判别法", "级数收敛定义"], "metadata": {"capture_ids": ["MFI-CAP-5ddebce7fe44e72c2bbf1e9b"], "closeout_id": "MFI-CLOSE-f2241c9bc6e70d4d5825f897", "conversation_complete": true, "coverage": "full_bytes", "files": [{"path": "/Users/xiazhibin/Documents/kaoyan-math/数学一回滚复习系统/快速入库来源/2026-08-31/MATHPKG-7af5add374ee8efc6732ef58/conversation.json", "sha256": "e17dda2d9f53ae990c3ba5dfc2dd2fd44c9671f1ad462a71483faecefa9e5762", "status": "verified", "text_status": "available"}, {"path": "/Users/xiazhibin/Documents/kaoyan-math/数学一回滚复习系统/快速入库来源/2026-08-31/MATHPKG-7af5add374ee8efc6732ef58/source.json", "sha256": "d3ddc1f27568a8e65947b5fb212f808aeecbcaaca9a3b9d2232e615c0543dfcc", "status": "verified", "text_status": "available"}, {"path": "/Volumes/T9-Data/03_数学/资料库/原始会话资料/2026-08-31/MATHPKG-7af5add374ee8efc6732ef58/attachments/question_image_01.png", "sha256": "71a2ac9bf67e9a9112dda23c654a9ef06eaa8b1cd530307e9c55abcbdd08aeb0", "status": "verified", "text_status": "text_unavailable_no_ocr"}], "original_path": "/Volumes/T9-Data/03_数学/资料库/原始会话资料/2026-08-31/MATHPKG-7af5add374ee8efc6732ef58", "original_sha256": "8069e65412e46f01fab2aea5d7d74a208c3335224c75ca0ee2b477520bb85a49", "personal_evidence": false, "receipt_id": "MATH-ARCHIVE-6042ff3c7ea57f67fd178f20", "role": "raw_unadjudicated_not_new_wrong_cause", "selected_user_sequence": 1, "selection": "first_complete_user_turn", "status": "verified", "terminal_outcomes": ["recurrence_recorded"], "user_turn_cache": "错题知识网络/个人知识点索引/source_cache/962513a79601dd3485cd20c0ae6d4b6bb1d6b9ff75e24d6623b014a1253615df.users.json", "user_turn_cache_sha256": "962513a79601dd3485cd20c0ae6d4b6bb1d6b9ff75e24d6623b014a1253615df", "user_turn_count": 3, "user_turn_provenance": [{"character_range": [0, 442], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": null, "raw_text_sha256": "46a0e41e48cd6d51bdb13c218c9760a91b31fbb97b872fd9e21c75d6a286f360", "role": "user", "sequence": 1}, {"character_range": [0, 172], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "649dc62f03cef2da05d05d4f72884fde6f370636d52ff54b390a22f106db274f", "role": "user", "sequence": 3}, {"character_range": [0, 17], "next_role": null, "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "6d1ad98a90051777d61aff819c72bf909a4986a9bf4b338e1e84a9a267d03080", "role": "user", "sequence": 5}]}, "source_kind": "accepted_conversation_excerpt", "text": "/Users/xiazhibin/Documents/kaoyan-math/错题知识网络/可视化错题详情/高等数学/GS-564\\_138677.md 这道题我有点卡住了。\n\n通过它一阶导大于 0，可以推出这是个正项级数；通过它二阶导小于 0，可以推断它单调递减。然后题目给出了 lim(x→+∞) f(x) = a，我暂且不知道这个条件有什么用，但我知道这个级数是正项级数且单调递减。\n\n我记得级数收敛的定义里，如果它是正项级数、单调递减且通项趋于 0，那它是不是就收敛了？那我是不是就要去证明 lim(x→+∞) f'(x) = 0？只要证明了这一点就没问题了。\n\n我逻辑没问题吧？但这里要怎么证明导数在正无穷时趋向于 0 呢？\n\n如果用导数定义去证的话，我也不会证：已知 lim(x→+∞) f(x) = a，那分子上的 f(+∞) 是什么？分母上的 x - (+∞) 又是什么？\n\n你看我这是思路有问题，还是单纯卡在不知道怎么证 lim(x→+∞) f'(x) = 0 了？"}